This is a tricky one, we can do it but we need to remember people will then want to add any dom handler to it this way.

What do you think of this:

```
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.hits({
    container: '#hits-container',
    onDomNodeAdded: (domNode, hitData) => {
      // do anything you want
    }
  })
);
```
